      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPIRIT OF SAHARA (3) ran sixth last start at this track over 2130m, beaten 11 metres. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Big chance in a similar race. TRIROYALE BRIGADE NZ (5) finished second at his most recent outing, beaten a head, in a nice return to form at Pinjarra over 1684m. Meeting a deeper field this time but he good enough to play a major role. GELSOMINO AMAL (2) should be at her peak for this. Finished seventh over 1730m at this track at the latest appearance a week ago. Sure to give the top fancies plenty to think about. MIKI WINDERMERE (9) broke last start and finished 10 metres from the winner in fifth over 2190m at Northam unfortunate start to this prep. Will need a bit of luck negotiating a very wide starting position. Facing a tougher assignment but a big run is possible if his race manners improve.",
